#: admin/help-tabs.php:27 admin/help-tabs.php:42 includes/functions.php:695
#: includes/tabs/tab-registration.php:32
msgid "Registration"
msgstr "Registratie"

#: admin/help-tabs.php:28
msgid ""
"The general setting for if 'users can register' is now disabled and is "
"controlled by the setting on this page."
msgstr ""
"Je algemene instelling voor of 'gebruikers kunnen registreren' is "
"uitgeschakeld en wordt nu beheerd door de instelling op deze pagina."

#: admin/help-tabs.php:29
msgid ""
"The \"Registration\" tab has several options to change registration "
"settings, such as:"
msgstr ""
"De \"Registratie\" tab heeft verschillende opties voor registratie, zoals:"

#: admin/help-tabs.php:31
msgid "registering with email address only"
msgstr "registreer met alleen email adres"

#: admin/help-tabs.php:32
msgid "use first/last name"
msgstr "activeer voor- en achternaam"

#: admin/help-tabs.php:33
msgid "make first/last name required"
msgstr "maak voor- en achternaam verplicht"

#: admin/help-tabs.php:34
msgid "activate recaptcha"
msgstr "activeer recaptcha"

#: admin/help-tabs.php:35
msgid "activate honeypot"
msgstr "activeer honeypot"

#: admin/help-tabs.php:36
msgid "activate privacy checkbox"
msgstr "activeer privacy checkbox"

#: admin/help-tabs.php:47 admin/help-tabs.php:56 includes/functions.php:738
#: includes/tabs/tab-pages.php:38
msgid "Pages"
msgstr "Pagina's"

#: admin/help-tabs.php:48
msgid ""
"The \"Pages\" tab shows which pages are used for which action. The plugin "
"relies on this, so make sure every action has a page set for it."
msgstr ""
"Deze pagina toont welke pagina's gebruikt worden voor welke actie. Dit is "
"vereist voor de plugin , dus zorg ervoor dat elke actie een pagina heeft "
"ingesteld."

#: admin/help-tabs.php:50
msgid "Choose a page in your default language."
msgstr "Kies een pagina in je default taal."

#: admin/help-tabs.php:61 admin/help-tabs.php:90 includes/functions.php:703
#: includes/tabs/tab-emails.php:24
msgid "Emails"
msgstr "Emails"

#: admin/help-tabs.php:62
msgid ""
"You can add any HTML you want in the email messages. Be sure to use the "
"preview mode, before using it."
msgstr ""
"Je kan HTML toevoegen in de email berichten. Gebruik de preview mode, voor "
"je ze verstuurt."

#: admin/help-tabs.php:63
msgid ""
"Save yourself a lot of work per email and use the template option. This is "
"then wrapped around each message."
msgstr ""
"Bespaar jezelf veel tijd per email en gebruik de template optie. Deze wordt "
"dan om elk bericht 'gewrapped’."

#: admin/help-tabs.php:64
msgid "These are the available variables in emails."
msgstr "Dit zijn de beschikbare variabelen in emails."

#: admin/help-tabs.php:66
msgid "only in user activation email"
msgstr "alleen in gebruikersactivatie email"

#: admin/help-tabs.php:80
msgid "available in every email"
msgstr "beschikbaar in elke email"

#: admin/help-tabs.php:82
msgid "only available in password reset email"
msgstr "alleen beschikbaar in wachtwoord reset email"

#: admin/help-tabs.php:83
msgid "on our website"
msgstr "op onze website"

